      "en": "John was clothed with camel’s hair and a leather belt around his waist. He ate locusts and wild honey.",
      "ko": "요한은 약대털을 입고 허리에 가죽띠를 띠고 메뚜기와 석청을 먹더라",
      "source_text_hash": "3a31a1c80b23b4d08429cd25634c70d1eb901e4327f6ada8653d30b6ed3413ee",
      "translation_text_hash": "db3dc1f520cd5e8be4471eb0b579b735c2e2e5cca0378e1c8474e09cc86d2cf5",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "요한은 약대털을 입고 허리에 가죽띠를 띠고 메뚜기와 석청을 먹더라"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "db3dc1f520cd5e8be4471eb0b579b735c2e2e5cca0378e1c8474e09cc86d2cf5"
      ]
