        "chapter": 1,
        "verse": 13
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "MRK",
          "chapter": 1,
          "verse": 13
        }
      ],
      "en": "He was there in the wilderness forty days, tempted by Satan. He was with the wild animals; and the angels were serving him.",
      "ko": "광야에서 사십 일을 계셔서 사단에게 시험을 받으시며 들짐승과 함께 계시니 천사들이 수종들더라",
      "source_text_hash": "a1908b4cf60cf179998b7c950b9a9ee2c2576eedaaf3a0c7d79662d4253b6475",
      "translation_text_hash": "67469ca7682dea206378e94e11a547bef062cbb3ea839f600f20bc2e08d9db64",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
