      "en": "He healed many who were sick with various diseases and cast out many demons. He didn’t allow the demons to speak, because they knew him.",
      "ko": "예수께서 각색 병든 많은 사람을 고치시며 많은 귀신을 내어 쫓으시되 귀신이 자기를 알므로 그 말하는 것을 허락지 아니하시니라",
      "source_text_hash": "81a4c2c35dae7e8e6f2e03e9a7f031930b62f0008b99eacd6c8f1232b7ce008e",
