      "en": "A leper came to him, begging him, kneeling down to him, and saying to him, “If you want to, you can make me clean.”",
      "ko": "한 문둥병자가 예수께 와서 꿇어 엎드리어 간구하여 가로되 원하시면 저를 깨끗케 하실 수 있나이다",
      "source_text_hash": "090de8e99308653bdcd90cde4cda481399191cc961f57c98bfbc2280b218777a",
      "translation_text_hash": "a49fcb3d43432f991d37c8ab7494cbd872d9bd41a686bf5f8fc0d707f5f84326",
